&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content warning&lt;/strong&gt;: This tale contains (censored) deadnaming; thinly veiled trans- and xenophobia; heavily implied war crimes; and fascist elements. Reader discretion is advised.&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
