&lt;p&gt;Director,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Attached below you will find all the information we have gathered, concerning the leadership of the Security and Containment Protectorate (hereafter designated KTO-0001-Bellfather). With your approval, I can accelerate plans to activate the sleeper agents we&#039;ve embedded in the ranks of this organization and begin Liquidating.&lt;/p&gt;
