				<description>


&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;acs-hybrid-text-bar acs-{$include-secondary} acs-text-version acs-clear-2 acs-Euclid acs-{$secondary-class} acs-vlam acs-warning&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/anomaly-classification-system-guide&quot;&gt;Link To Guide&lt;/a&gt;
